            <ArticleTitle>Top 60 medications used for orofacial pain treatment.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>747-67</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article introduces the 60 top pharmacologic treatments provided for chronic orofacial pain patients. It explains that the majority of &quot;chronic&quot; orofacial pain patients will not find a &quot;cure&quot; to their pain with medications but may find a way to manage their pain. The medications in this article are the most commonly utilized &quot;pain&quot; medications and where it exists. This article reviews some of the current evidence supporting their use on chronic orofacial pain disorders.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
